at":"2025-06-11T00:27:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107357","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107357","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107357.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107357.patch","merged_at":"2025-06-11T00:27:53Z"},"body":"Both the [GDScript](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_styleguide.html#whitespace:~:text=One%20exception%20to%20this%20is%20for%20single%2Dline%20dictionary%20declarations%2C%20where%20a%20space%20should%20be%20added%20after%20the%20opening%20brace%20and%20before%20the%20closing%20brace.) and the [C#](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.html#:~:text=After%20the%20opening%20brace%2C%20and%20before%20the%20closing%20brace%20in%20a%20single%20line%20initializer.) style guides state that a space should be added after opening braces and before ending braces in single-line dictionary declarations. This PR enforces that guideline in various code samples.\r\n\r\nThis PR does _not_ change the style of the following:\r\n- Dictionaries passed to functions (e.g. `foo({\"some_key\": \"bar\"})`)\r\n- Single-line dictionary arrays (e.g. `[{\"godot\": true}]`)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gi